## The abandoned mine.

## Room 24. LOOK.BAS 2400 and 2450.

create the Mine Enterance
  a room
  room name:
    Mine enterance
  exits, one-way: northeast to the East-West Tunnel 22, southeast to the East-West Tunnel 21, up to the Mine 25, down to the Mine 25

  You are at the enterance to an abandoned mine. Exits go NW and SW,{br}
  and a dark mine corridor is below.

## Room 25. LOOK.BAS 2500 and 2550.

create the Mine 25
  a room
  room name:
    Mine
  exits, one-way: up to the Mine Enterance, down to the Mine 26

  You are in a dark mine corridor.  the corridor continues{br}
  up and down. The floor is a grating.

## Room 26. LOOK.BAS 2600 and 2650.

create the Mine 26
  a room
  room name:
    Mine
  exits, one-way: up to the Mine 25, down to the Mine 27

  You are in a dark mine corridor.  the corridor continues{br}
  up and down. The floor is a grating.

## Room 27. LOOK.BAS 2700 and 2750.

create the Mine 27
  a room
  room name:
    Mine
  exits, one-way: up to the Mine 26, down to the Carbide Room

  You are in a dark mine corridor.  the corridor continues{br}
  up and down. The floor is a grating.

## Room 28. LOOK.BAS 2800 and 2850.

create the Carbide Room
  a room
  room name:
    Carbide room
  exits, one-way: up to the Mine 27, out to the Mine 27

  This room is the bottom of the mine. The ground contains{br}
  deposits of carbide (CaC) and gold.The only exit is up.
